  title: True Beauty
  art: {fileID: 0}
  textDisplay: Perfection... many have spoke of it being unnatainable by man. Yet through potato, maybe it can be achieved. They've discovered the arts - painting, sculpting, even handdrawn animation. Should we encourage it?
  choice1: They're just food for us. Destroy any sign of intelligence.
  choice2: We'll wait and see how far they grow.
